      "message": "test: assert no temporary wallet is created on disk during exportwatchonlywallet\n\nThe intermediate wallet is now in-memory with the fixed name\n\"exportwatchonly_temp\". Verify via assert_debug_log that this name appears\n(confirming the in-memory path) and the old source-wallet-derived temp name\ndoes not (which would indicate a file-based intermediate wallet). Cherry-\npicking this commit onto a tree without the implementation correctly fails.",
